{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RESIDUUM is an atmospheric psychological horror experience made by Will Nightingale.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You needed the money. They needed a lab rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as an experiment in an underground facility soon descended into something unexplainable. You wake up alone, surrounded by silence \u2014 no way out, no one left. Only the hum of machines... and something else moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088450/extras/967ecdc4dd26a7e56d17d74d179fcbee.avif?t=1760614533\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Tensions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an unreliable flashlight, you must descend deeper into the unknown, uncovering fragments of what remains. Keep the lights alive. Keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shadow hides a secret. Every sound could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088450/extras/6c62c1935f330310a2a8c04426887b85.avif?t=1760614533\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a semi-open world decaying underground facility consumed by darkness and dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is your only ally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the story through scattered recordings, pictures and notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and environmental tension that pull you into the abyss.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamst